\subsection{Proofs of Section \ref{sec: smoothing_measure}}
\begin{proof}[Proof of Proposition \ref{prop: h_properties}]
    Both equalities follow from rewriting the definition of $h$ in \eqref{eq: def_h}, whereas the continuity claims are a consequence of the dominated convergence theorem and almost sure continuity of $X$.
