We conclude the following proposition.

\begin{prop}
Let $Y$ be a countable union of closed nowhere dense subsets in $\left[ 0,\pi\right]$. Then
\begin{equation*}
\sigma(T_{\theta_{0}}\upharpoonright_{\M})\cap\bigcup_{\theta\in Y}\sigma_{p}(T_{\theta}\upharpoonright_{\M})
\end{equation*}
is a countable union of closed nowhere dense subsets in $\sigma(T_{\theta_{0}}\upharpoonright_{\M})$.
