\section{Biological basis}
\label{bb}
In the following subsections the mechanisms leading to insulin secretion in $\beta$-cells and glucagon secretion in $\alpha$-cells of pancreas, schematically presented in Figure~\ref{f.sch}, are briefly discussed, in accordance with the papers:~\cite{bb1,bb2,bb3}.

