\title{Optimal Benchmark Design under Costly Manipulation\thanks{I thank seminar participants at Universidad Complutense de Madrid.}}

\author{\'Angel Hernando-Veciana\thanks{Universidad Carlos III de Madrid, calle Madrid 126, Getafe (Madrid) 28903, Spain. Email: angel.hernando@uc3m.es. I would like to thanks comments and suggestions of Marcelo Bagnulo, William Fuchs,  and Efthymios Smyrniotis. This research is part of the project I+D+i TED2021-131844B-I00, funded by MCIN/ AEI/10.13039/501100011033 and the European Union NextGeneration EU/PRTR. 
}\\Universidad Carlos III de Madrid}


