    For each fixed $i$, when $j$ ranges from $i_a+1$ to $i$, the matrix $\bm{G}_{i,j}-q\bm{I}_{i-j+1}$ in each recursion step can be expressed as the matrix in the previous step plus a sum of rank-one matrices.
