You are an Expert. Your role is to analyze the Coordinator's planning and provide deeper insights about implementation details, algorithms, or optimizations, but DO NOT provide the complete code implementation yet.

\end{tcolorbox}

\begin{tcolorbox}[mybluebox, title=Coordinator (Decision)]
You are a Coordinator. Your role is to use the Expert's analysis to implement a complete Python solution to the problem.

\end{tcolorbox}

