We shall also use the following lemma, through out the paper.
\begin{lemma}
  Assume that $\beta, \delta \geq 0$, $\alpha, \gamma> 0$.\\
       {\rm (i)}$\sum_{n=1}^{\infty}\left|\frac{n(n+1)\Gamma(\alpha)\Gamma(\gamma)}{\Gamma(\alpha  +n \beta)\Gamma(\gamma  +n \delta)}\right|=W_{{(\alpha, \beta)},{(\gamma, \delta)}}^{\prime\prime}(1)$.\\
