We have
\begin{align*}
         S_{3}\leq &\sum_{n=2}^{\infty}n(n-\alpha)\left|\frac{\Gamma(\alpha_{1})\Gamma(\gamma_{1})}{\Gamma(\alpha_{1}  +(n-1)\beta_{1})\Gamma(\gamma_{1}  +(n-1) \delta_{1})}\right|\\
