We transfer considering traces as equivalence classes to the level of
languages and call a word language $L \subseteq \Sigma^\omega$
\Def{trace closed} iff for all words $w,w' \in \Sigma^\omega$ with
$w \approx w'$, it holds $w \in L$ iff $w' \in L$.

