\subsection{Galactic Metallicity Gradients}

We compute both linear and bilinear fits to the EH catalog open cluster sample in radius vs [Fe/H] space. As in the main body of the paper, both Galactocentric radius (\rgc) and guiding center radius (\rguide) are used to compute the two fits, which are shown in Figure \ref{fig:eh_feh_grad}. With respect to $R_{GC}$, the linear gradient was calculated to be $-0.081 \pm 0.007 \text{ dex kpc}^{-1}$.
